    "detailed_description": "<h1>LEFT ALONE REWORK</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hey everyone, I'm currently working on a massive update to Left Alone. I will be making regular posts about this on the Steam page, and you can follow all of it on my YouTube / X accounts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can expect brand new quality of life features: Controller support, full achievements, improved UIs, enhanced interaction and usability. Additionally, I'll be working on brand new gameplay features, including new puzzles, locations, expansions to the lore, enriched storytelling, item collection, usability, and most importantly - immersion. Expect updates to most of the game areas with new textures, models, lighting, effects, and much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I really appreciate everyone who has played Left Alone over the years, and I'm always happy to hear from you as I'm only a message away! :)  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>**Make sure to WISHLIST Left Alone: Rebirth today and if you bought the previous game (On this page) you will be able to redeem a free copy during release.</strong></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><strong>Left Alone</strong> plunges you into a first-person psychological horror journey, where darkness and memories intertwine. As secrets emerge from shadows, use your wits to solve puzzles and explore haunting, forgotten locations. Every step echoes with the past; can you face the truths that await?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/417750/extras/3c92ea93395aff94365ff04f1b47ecf8.poster.avif?t=1736250445\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/417750/extras/3c92ea93395aff94365ff04f1b47ecf8.webm?t=1736250445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/417750/extras/3c92ea93395aff94365ff04f1b47ecf8.mp4?t=1736250445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>Story</u></strong></h2>Step into the shoes of Joel Dent, an ex-military officer, recent divorcee, and individual recovering from physical trauma. Joel and his best friends had planned a fun and adventurous weekend of camping in the forests of Wisconsin. However, strange events lead him to an abandoned school with a horrific past. As Joel searches for his friends, he uncovers horrors that surpass his worst nightmares, making him wonder if he should have stayed &quot;Left Alone.&quot;<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/417750/extras/3db8d295284de35696dffb137d12c24f.poster.avif?t=1736250445\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/417750/extras/3db8d295284de35696dffb137d12c24f.webm?t=1736250445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/417750/extras/3db8d295284de35696dffb137d12c24f.mp4?t=1736250445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>Key Features</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Psychological Horror:</strong> Unearth clues, notes, and memories from past students and visitors of the \u201cMount High School\u201d.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Spooky Environments:</strong> Dive into multiple settings, from hiking trails to the confines of Mount High School, its surrounding areas and maybe even some secrets along the way.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Eerie Atmosphere:</strong> Experience a suspenseful ambience with audio meticulously designed for each locale, building tension.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Engaging Gameplay:</strong> Encounter shocking and immersive moments throughout, designed to cultivate a sense of mystery and discovery.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Puzzles &amp; Clues:</strong> Solve puzzles and hunt for clues to find traces of your friends' whereabouts. Tread carefully; you might uncover more than you bargained for.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/417750/extras/0897b0d06fe4d270872558f8f991c66c.poster.avif?t=1736250445\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/417750/extras/0897b0d06fe4d270872558f8f991c66c.webm?t=1736250445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/417750/extras/0897b0d06fe4d270872558f8f991c66c.mp4?t=1736250445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>Development</u></strong></h2>Developed with passion, Left Alone is the result of two dedicated developers who invested two rigorous years into its creation. We hope you enjoy the experience as much as we enjoyed crafting it.",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Left Alone</strong> plunges you into a first-person psychological horror journey, where darkness and memories intertwine. As secrets emerge from shadows, use your wits to solve puzzles and explore haunting, forgotten locations. Every step echoes with the past; can you face the truths that await?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/417750/extras/3c92ea93395aff94365ff04f1b47ecf8.poster.avif?t=1736250445\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/417750/extras/3c92ea93395aff94365ff04f1b47ecf8.webm?t=1736250445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/417750/extras/3c92ea93395aff94365ff04f1b47ecf8.mp4?t=1736250445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>Story</u></strong></h2>Step into the shoes of Joel Dent, an ex-military officer, recent divorcee, and individual recovering from physical trauma. Joel and his best friends had planned a fun and adventurous weekend of camping in the forests of Wisconsin. However, strange events lead him to an abandoned school with a horrific past. As Joel searches for his friends, he uncovers horrors that surpass his worst nightmares, making him wonder if he should have stayed &quot;Left Alone.&quot;<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/417750/extras/3db8d295284de35696dffb137d12c24f.poster.avif?t=1736250445\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/417750/extras/3db8d295284de35696dffb137d12c24f.webm?t=1736250445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/417750/extras/3db8d295284de35696dffb137d12c24f.mp4?